**Card identity:** A card carries `url` and `articleKey`. `url` is the address
the card was added with and links to. `articleKey` is what dedup compares, so
Substack's several routes to one article resolve to one card. `articleKey` is
indexed but not unique, because a board written before version 2 can already
hold a duplicate and a unique index would make the upgrade throw. Boards that
already hold such a pair keep it; delete one by hand.
